# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev`. `.dev.vars*` is gitignored.
#
# Better Auth's cookie/token signing secret. Any long random string works
# locally; production/staging use a real secret set per-project with
# `wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET --name dreamport` (or
# `--name dreamport-staging`).
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=dev-only-change-me-to-something-random-and-long

# Cloudflare Turnstile SECRET key, used server-side to verify the widget
# token on the send-OTP path. The send path fails closed (503) without it.
# This default is Cloudflare's documented always-pass test secret — it pairs
# with the always-pass site key in `.env`. Production/staging set a real
# per-project secret with `wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
# --name dreamport` (or `--name dreamport-staging`); see docs/deployment.md.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA

# How sign-in emails are delivered. Unset (or `mock`) records the 6-digit code
# in an in-memory buffer and sends nothing — the default for local work. It
# does not log the code (issue #41); read it from the D1 `verification` table
# (see docs/deployment.md). Set `resend` only to exercise the real Resend
# path; it then requires RESEND_API_KEY and throws on first use without it.
# The From address is not a var — it's the EMAIL_FROM constant in
# src/worker/email/sender.ts, and a real send needs its domain verified in
# the Resend account behind the key.
# EMAIL_MODE=resend
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# App-wide cap on sign-in codes sent per UTC day — the Resend-quota guard
# (issue #24 / ADR-0007). Unset ⇒ 90. Set a small value to exercise the cap
# locally (the send path 429s once the day's count reaches it).
# SEND_OTP_DAILY_CAP=5
